B.T7=new A.c8(B.xD,["Opens Dashboard, Batch Log and Audit Log. See totals, batches and the audit trail (read-only).","Opens Users, Create User and Role-Based Users. Create accounts below your own role.","Opens App Branding. Change the app name, logo, theme and draw settings.","Lets you set the draw time inside Draw Control.","Lets you switch auto/manual draw and use Draw Now.","Opens Transactions. View and edit transaction records.","Opens Daily Reports. See draw history, bets, payouts and totals.","Lets you set the minimum and maximum bet amounts.","Opens Draw Control and Risk Analysis. Declare the winning number.","Opens User Role System. Change role permissions.","Opens the Agent Panel. Place bets for players from the agent\u2019s own balance.","Opens My Bets. See placed bets, tickets and payouts.","Opens Settlements and Loan Requests. Confirm settlement records and approve loan requests from agents.","Lets this account sign in with face or fingerprint on their own device. The fingerprint / face stays on their phone \u2014 it is never stored here."],t.li)
